   "text": "the target, built after your look (the live Task page is MindMap · Status today): the same six\nviews, ⚙️ Process before 📊 Results; P, a Run's pop-out, opens from any Run row; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\neach view's 🙋 Interaction holds its own forms; the right rail ends Skills · Files, as live (261106); a form shows in the step its answer changes",
